From: lavachemist <48248311+lavachemist@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] cpufreq: dt-platdev: leave Eliza to qcom-cpufreq-hw

With CPU OPP tables (they carry the L3 votes) the generic driver tried to
register on Eliza as well and failed, -EEXIST, at every boot. Every other
Qualcomm SoC with qcom-cpufreq-hw is on this list.
---
--- a/drivers/cpufreq/cpufreq-dt-platdev.c
+++ b/drivers/cpufreq/cpufreq-dt-platdev.c
@@ -155,6 +155,7 @@
 	{ .compatible = "nvidia,tegra234", },
 
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,apq8096", },
+	{ .compatible = "qcom,eliza", },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8909", },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8996", },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,msm8998", },
